   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Govt. NFE (Non-formal Education)project for 11-45 yrs. GOB,NORAD, Sida.1 year extension of contract C23040 between Swedec and Sida for the NFE Long-Term International Consultant under component 03 for this contribution for the period 01 January to 31 December 2000.C23040 ext upto June 30, 2002. From 2002 the status of the components are: a) 01 main activities - no disbursement in 2002,2003.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project closed 30 June 2002. b) 02- Rev/Mon/Audit. Incl.costs for audit, HYC &amp; JT, SEK 700,000, for completion report, SSI, SEK 455,000 c) 03-NFE TA costs 1999 to 2001. d) 04 - New NFE TA costs from July,&apos;02 - June&apos;03, SEK 2,500,000. e) 05 - Rajbari MER April&apos;02 - June&apos;03, SEK 1,500,000. f) 06-New project prep, SEK 3,500,000.</narrative>
